# The repository root ignores *.md and out/. This workspace's docs and rendered outputs are deliverables.
!*.md
!out/
node_modules/
# Full-page captures are large and re-creatable with `npm run capture`; the crops the films use are kept.
screens/*-full.png
films/*/audio/mix_prenorm.wav
films/*/audio/mix_limited.wav
# Re-creatable intermediates: stems come from tools/audio.py; source.zip repackages files already in this folder.
films/*/audio/bed.wav
films/*/audio/sfx.wav
films/*/audio/vo_track.wav
out/*/source.zip
